  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "Given equation: 81 + 3 ÷ 27 - 8 × 24 = 25\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) ÷ and +\n\nGiven: 81 + 3 ÷ 27 - 8 × 24 = 25\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**81 ÷ 3**__ + 27 - 8 × 24 = 25\n\n⇒ 27 + 27 - __**8 × 24**__ = 25\n\n⇒ __**27 + 27**__ - 192 = 25\n\n⇒ __54 - 192__ = 25\n\n⇒ - 138 ≠ 25\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) + and -\n\nGiven: 81 + 3 ÷ 27 - 8 × 24 = 25\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 81 - __**3 ÷ 27**__ + 8 × 24 = 25\n\n⇒ 81 - 0.11 + __**8 × 24**__ = 25\n\n⇒ __**81**__ - 0.11 __**+ **____192__ = 25\n\n⇒ __273 - 0.11__ = 25\n\n⇒ 272.89 ≠ 25\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) ÷ and ×\n\nGiven: 81 + 3 ÷ 27 - 8 × 24 = 25\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 81 + 3 × 27 - __**8 ÷ 24**__ = 25\n\n⇒ 81 + __**3 × 27**__ - 0.33 = 25\n\n⇒ __**81 + **81__ - 0.33 = 25\n\n⇒ __162____ - 0.33__ = 25\n\n⇒ 161.67 ≠ 25\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 4) × and +**\n\nGiven: 81 + 3 ÷ 27 - 8 × 24 = 25\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**81 × 3 ÷ 27**__ - 8 + 24 = 25\n\n⇒ __9__ - 8 __**+ 24**__ = 25\n\n⇒ __33 - 8__ = 25\n\n⇒ **25 = 25**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
